==Trivia==
*Panic Tower's Japanese name, Igusa-tō (イグサ塔, "[[wikipedia:Soft rush|Soft Rush]] Tower) is a spoof of [[Seaweed Shallows]]' Japanese name (テングサ島, "Tengusa Island"), which can be read as "Tengusashima" or "Tengusatō".
*This is the only stage in Uncanny Legends to feature Teacher Bear.

